Nothing clouded the smile I showed Himeo.%K%P
虽然我对姬绪小姐露出了并不别扭笑容…%K%P
But I couldn't really blame the tears trickling down my\ncheek on a yawn, either.%K%P
即便如此，因为打了个哈欠的缘故，\n传到脸颊上的感觉也无法忽视了。%K%P
