%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI do.\d%K%P
「想见…」%K%P
I wanted to see her. More than anything.%K%P
我想见她…\n迫不及待地想见她。%K%P
The month we spent apart felt like an eternity.%K%P
日日思君不见君，一月不见，\n却感觉仿佛过了一生般冗长久远，如隔三秋，无穷无尽。%K%P
I felt so intoxicated by her that merely spotting her at a\npublic place would have made me rush up and catch her in\nan embrace.%K%P
今日如若得见一面，或许即便在众人环视之中，\n我也会紧紧地拥抱着她不放吧，\n我，已经中了她的毒。%K%P
