Under normal circumstances, my indecisive attitude would\nalways send the usually strong-willed Himeo into a fit of\nrage, but...%K%P
看到我消极的态度，换做平日，\n她或许会骂我『你怎么这么磨叽啊！』\n然后怒气冲冲地训斥一顿也不奇怪。%K%P
...this time, she faced me head-on, listening to my words\nwith boundless patience.%K%P
而今日，姫绪小姐直直地凝视着我，\n耐心地听着我说话。%K%P
