%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA decision I'd make for her sake would only end up\ncausing her sorrow... I've been there before.\d%K%P
「害怕本来为她着想的决定，\n却可能招致她的不幸…\n因为，我已经有过一次经验了」%K%P
Back then, I only had two choices -- to accept or deny.\nTo write down my name or tear up the paper.%K%P
那个时候，剩下给我的，是承诺还是否定…\n是签下名字，还是撕破扔掉，仅仅这两个选择。%K%P
And I still managed to pick the wrong choice. I ended up\ncausing a single woman to suffer all on her own for two\nlong years.%K%P
如此简单的问题，我的选择却大错特错…\n两年间，一直让她孤苦伶仃地独自生活。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThis time, I have several people I hold dear. They are my\nfortune, the fuel that drives me onwards, and... my\nirreplaceable treasures. Himeo... you're no exception,\neither.\d%K%P
「如今的我，有众多所爱的人。\n她们是我的财产，我的依靠，我的…不可替代的珍宝。\n…当然，姫绪小姐，也是其中的一个」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut the way I tried to rank them only ended up shattering\nour relationships to pieces... I ended up hurting the\nperson I ranked as second, and caused unbearable pain to\nthe one I held in the highest regard...\d%K%P
「如果把她们擅自排序，就会破坏如今的关系…\n到头来，会伤了次爱的心，\n而且更深地伤害最爱…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCan you guarantee it won't happen all over again?\d%K%P
「“不会发展成那样”这样的保证…存在吗？」%K%P
I had no confidence in my decisions... because I had yet\nto make a single one that actually brought anyone true\nhappiness.%K%P
我，对我的判断没有自信。\n因为直到如今，我都没有让任何人得到幸福。%K%P
No matter how hard I tried, my happiness would always slip\nthrough my fingers, leaving behind only a trail of\nmistakes.%K%P
挣扎了，努力了，拼命了，\n幸福却依然从我的指间悄然滑落，留给我的只有扼腕叹息…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
