If what she said was true, it did sound like the heinous\nresult of one abhorrent man's life.%K%P
姫绪小姐所言，如果属实，\n那我的确是个最差劲的男人，人生也真是最差劲了。%K%P
And if I'd simply been interpreting last year's events in\na way that felt convenient to me...%K%P
于是…\n回想起去年的我，\n所有的事实，如果能够得到合理的解释…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's... insane.\d%K%P
