My young, unpredictable superior had finally reprimanded\nme.%K%P
我这怒气冲冲的晚辈上司，\n终于对我的消极态度按耐不住了。%K%P
She looked down at me from her usual, higher angle, loudly\ngiving me some pep talk despite not being all that used to\nit herself.%K%P
从她拿手的高高在上角度，\n用不怎么拿手的表达方式，给予着我激励。%K%P
She pushed my back.%K%P
她在背后推了我一把。%K%P
I could see hints of irritation in her eyes, but she\nnonetheless endured it, waiting for me to make my own\ndecision.%K%P
她的眼中，虽然有些焦急，\n即便如此，还是等待着我、等待着我做出决断。%K%P
