This time, I'd settle things once and for all.%K%P
这次，才是最后的决战。%K%P
On February 14, an official workday for all adults across\nthe country, as well as a day on which women confessed\ntheir love...%K%P
２月１４日。是对于社会人士来说，平常的一天。\n是从女性那里得到爱的告白的一天。%K%P
I would confess mine to -her-.%K%P
而我，将要对她发表爱的告白。%K%P
